# TheHive Provider

The TheHive provider lets you manage configuration-level resources
(organisations, user profiles, custom fields, etc.) on a
[TheHive 5](https://docs.strangebee.com/) instance as Terraform code.

## Authentication

The provider authenticates via an API key.  You can set credentials in the
provider block or through environment variables:

| Provider attribute | Environment variable |
|--------------------|----------------------|
| `url`              | `THEHIVE_URL`        |
| `api_key`          | `THEHIVE_API_KEY`    |

